# The screen's QEMU run (test/qemu-recovery.sh, "screen"): screen-drive's script, a
# touchscreen and a power key against the real core over the pool disk (deployments
# A current, B previous, C). The host counts the confirmed operations in the core's log:
# exactly select, rollback and reset; everything else here is cancelled or ignored.
wait home 600
sh test -s /run/glassine/device/waveform.wbf
# select C: cancelled first
tap Deployments
wait deployments
tap C
wait deployment
tap Start this one next
wait confirm-select 300
remember Start C
tap Cancel
wait cancelled 300
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
# a confirmation can't be skipped: taps on its button from before it is shown, a finger
# and the power key held down from before it until after it took input
tap Deployments
wait deployments
tap C
wait deployment
tap Start this one next
tapearly confirm-select
sleep 1500
page confirm-select
tap Cancel
wait cancelled 300
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
tap Deployments
wait deployments
tap C
wait deployment
tap Start this one next
holdearly confirm-select 1000
sleep 1500
page confirm-select
tap Cancel
wait cancelled 300
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
tap Deployments
wait deployments
tap C
wait deployment
tap Start this one next
keyearly confirm-select 1500
sleep 1500
page confirm-select
# now confirmed: select C
tap Start C
wait done 600
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
# rollback to B
tap Deployments
wait deployments
tap Roll back to B
wait confirm-rollback 300
tap Roll back
wait done 600
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
# reset system, confirmed
tap Reset
wait reset
tap Reset system
wait confirm-reset 300
tap Reset system
wait done 900
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
# the full reset with the power key alone: moved to, chosen, cancelled (Cancel comes first)
tap Reset
wait reset
focus Full reset
long
wait confirm-reset-full 300
long
wait cancelled 300
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
# diagnostics
tap Diagnostics
wait diag 600
tap Back to the start
wait home 300
# restart, cancelled
tap Restart
wait restart
tap Normal start
wait confirm-restart
tap Cancel
wait home 300
# no input: the idle notice; the power key brings the page back; then the core restarts
# it (the host checks; the restart page itself is in the headless run)
wait idle 120
short
wait home 60
wait idle 120
